observation("placebo-nocebo-pain-direction", "Pain-tolerance direction depends on test instructions", "benedetti2003-pain-suggestions", "Analgesic suggestions increase and hyperalgesic suggestions decrease measured tolerance in their tested groups. After ketorolac preconditioning, the opposite hyperalgesic description prevents the usual positive test-day response and yields lower tolerance. This does not show that verbal expectation controls every physiological endpoint.");
